      "writtenOn": "2017-05-15T15:00:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PS. I\u0027ve now got four public overloads of openConnection() for each combination of { proxy given / not given } and {socketFactory given/not given }, because I don\u0027t like using nullable arguments in APIs where a value of null may be accidental.\n\nThis does seem like an argument towards refactoring HttpURLConnectionFactory into a AndroidHttpBuilder class plus corresponding Builder class, but not sure if that\u0027s worth doing now - feels a bit like a yak chase.",
